    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33119" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκτῠπ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worked in relief</i>, Ion
				Trag.<i><span class="en">
				42
			</span></i>, Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.26
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιάλη . . ἔ. ζῷα ἔχουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).161
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				76
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκτυπα, τά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				35.152
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>distinct</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.21
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πως</span>
			<i>with a distinct impression</i> or <i>character</i>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκεχυμένως</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.171
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
