				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἐκτύπων γεγραμμένη [ἱστορία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Marcellin.
					<u>Vit. Thuc.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			.</div>
